  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated Water resource management - Water Scoping mission</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The scoping mission will assess water resource needs, institutional and governance arrangements, stakeholder priorities, and implementation options, while evaluating whether the programme should be embedded within the existing FNS portfolio or implemented as a standalone initiative linked to FNS programme. Expected outputs include a strategic framework, high-level intervention logic, recommended implementation modality, and procurement documents to support a planned launch in the fourth quarter of 2026.</narrative>
  </description>
